<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>What is a function?</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m00821</md:content-id>
    <md:title>What is a function?</md:title>
    <md:uuid>0d67d2af-431c-4deb-b887-2338b1fde6ea</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><div class="os-raise-familysupport">
  <para><link url="https://phet.colorado.edu/sims/html/function-builder/latest/function-builder_en.html">Access the interactive simulator</link> to begin this project.</para>
</div>

<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
    <para>In this activity, whenever you see 💬, stop and share your responses with your partner. If you have different responses, try to come to a consensus.</para>
    <para>In the first activity, you may have noticed that all of the simulation screens share a three-part structure. These three parts can be described in a variety of ways, such as the ones listed in the image below. </para>
    
    <para class="os-raise-text-center">
      <figure><media alt="Insert Alt Text"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/6f0608c5e977814d21d6e7162e63590c42fdf766"/></media></figure></para>
      
    
    <newline/><item>Come up with your own names or labels for the three parts of a function.</item> 
    
    <newline/><item> Share your labels with your group. Write down any similarities. 💬</item> 
    
    
    <para>For 3 - 4, use the following instructions.</para>
    
    <blockquote>Use the simulation screen labeled “Patterns”. Note you can switch between simulation screens using the toolbar located below the function builder.</blockquote>

    <newline/><item>The blue “builder” in the middle of the screen is a function. Describe what a function is using the labels you've agreed on as a class. 💬</item>
    
    <newline/><item>Suppose you build this function:</item>
    
    <para class="os-raise-text-center"><figure><media alt="Insert Alt Text"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/472602fc8a6a30d2b67496116f678a04b27ba1ab"/></media></figure></para>
    
    <list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
    
      <newline/><item>Complete the following table, sketching what happens after going through the function.</item>
    
    
    <table class="os-raise-midsizetable">
    <thead>
      <row>
        <entry scope="col" class="emphasis">Input</entry>
        <entry scope="col" class="emphasis">Output</entry>
      </row>
    
    </thead>
        <tbody>
          <row>
            <entry>
              <para><figure><media alt="Insert Alt Text"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/5ade9c9875850142c250514081296162039ffc7c"/></media></figure></para>
            </entry>
            <entry>
                <para><figure><media alt="Insert Alt Text"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/f32b1b77fc897c3527981c0f0c63f7272662193c"/></media></figure></para>
            </entry>
          </row>
          <row>
            <entry>
              <para><figure><media alt="Insert Alt Text"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/d40684fefef0f8a305446d58a02379d3e05bb5a0"/></media></figure></para>
            </entry>
            <entry>
                <newline/></entry>
          </row>
          <row>
            <entry>
              <para><figure><media alt="Insert Alt Text"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/88ff0c18c4a2f9184aba9422bfc8565c82ce01ad"/></media></figure></para>
            </entry>
            <entry>
                <newline/></entry>
          </row>
          <row>
            <entry>
              <para><figure><media alt="Insert Alt Text"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/ea0c7566bde8418a18c23f216ff8aeaa33d5882c"/></media></figure></para>
            </entry>
            <entry>
                <newline/></entry>
          </row>
          <row>
            <entry>
              <para><figure><media alt="Insert Alt Text"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/2cf2139db28e0dd0ede170641b87a036a429aa32"/></media></figure></para>
            </entry>
            <entry>
                <newline/></entry>
          </row>
          <row>
            <entry>
              <para><figure><media alt="Insert Alt Text"><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/6714bac310bfebbce8f48944eac3205bb55b7d3e"/></media></figure></para>
            </entry>
            <entry>
                <newline/></entry>
